2px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Yes. Hold USDC or USDT in your ElementPay balance and use it to fund any payout to Rwanda. ElementPay converts to RWF at a rate shown before you confirm and delivers on the local rail.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Can I hold RWF in an ElementPay account?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">ElementPay does not issue RWF accounts today. You can hold USD, EUR, GBP, USDC or USDT and convert to RWF at the moment you pay out.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">What currency does the recipient receive in Rwanda?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Recipients in Rwanda are paid in Rwandan francs (RWF). You can fund the payout from USD, EUR, GBP, any of ElementPay’s 30 account currencies, or USDC and USDT.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Is ElementPay a bank?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">No. ElementPay is a financial technology company. Banking services are provided by licensed partner institutions.</p></details></div></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);letter-spacing:-0.03em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Also in East Africa.</h2><a href=\"/coverage\" style=\"font-weight:600\">All 20 countries →</a></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(100%,220px),1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:24px\"><a href=\"/send-money-to-kenya\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ke.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:34px;height:23px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:600\">Kenya</span><span style=\"display:block;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">KES · M-Pesa</span></span></a><a href=\"/send-money-to-uganda\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ug.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:34px;height:23px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:600\">Uganda</span><span style=\"display:block;font-family:var